00:03:20.834 --> 00:03:24.759
--- Rikari Grimes, Acung, Alpi Syahril,
Isma Slamet, Adi Masteravatar ---

00:03:24.783 --> 00:03:32.658
Pasang namamu dengan support saya ke: trakteer.id/najatrirazaqa
